# Class: obo:ND_0001062 (diagnosis of syndrome)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:ND_0001062 obo:IAO_0000123)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:ND_0001062 "A diagnosis which indicates that a syndrome is hypothosized to inhere in an organsim.")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:ND_0001062 "Alexander P. Cox")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:ND_0001062 "Is the presence of a syndrome hypothosized?  Since a syndrome is a pattern of signs and symptoms, which are by definition observed or reported, is there a need to hypothesize their occurrence?  Perhaps the pattern can be hypothesized, but this too will typically (if not always) be observed or reported.

Perhaps the definition should be changed to: \"A diagnosis which indicates that a syndrome is exhibited by an organsim.\"?")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:ND_0001062 "diagnosis of syndrome")
SubClassOf(obo:ND_0001062 obo:OGMS_0000073)

