# Class: obo:ND_0001116 (diagnostic guideline for possible frontotemporal dementia)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:ND_0001116 "*** REVISE ***

Insidious onset, slow progression
Impaired behavior: 
-loss of personal awareness, Disinhibition, mental rigidity, Hyperorality, Stereotypy, Perseveration, utilization behavior, Distractibility, poor social judgment
Altered affect:
-Depression, Anxiety, Delusions, Somatic preoccupations, Apathy, Amimia
Speech disorder:
-Reduced, stereotypic, echolalic, perseveration, mutism
Physical signs:
-Primitive reflexes, Incontinence, Parkinsonism")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:ND_0001116 "Alexander P. Cox")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:ND_0001116 "diagnostic guideline for possible frontotemporal dementia")
SubClassOf(obo:ND_0001116 obo:ND_0001105)

