AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000232 obo:ND_0005033 "I don't think this class and its subclasses add anything to the ontology.  I think that everything that I originally wanted 'protein part' to do can be accommodated by using 'protein fragment', but this will require further review.

The original intention in creating this class was to identify fiat parts of longer amino acid chains in order to identify protein fragments as having originated in a larger amino acid chain which was later subjected to a \"snipping\" process that separated the fiat protein part and generated an independent continuant that is equivalent to the appropriate protein fragment.

Alexander P. Cox")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:ND_0005033 "protein part")
