# Class: obo:ND_0006006 (pathological aggresomal response)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:ND_0006006 "Pathological aggresomal response is the process that occurs when an aggresomal response becomes a pathological bodily process.  A pathological aggresomal response typically (always???) produces (results in???) too many aggresomes, which then typically become the material basis of one or more diseases.")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:ND_0006006 "Alexander P. Cox")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:ND_0006006 "pathological aggresomal response")
SubClassOf(obo:ND_0006006 obo:OGMS_0000061)

