# Class: obo:ND_0006009 (multiple sclerosis disease course)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:ND_0006009 "A disease course which realizes multiple sclerosis.")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000116 obo:ND_0006009 "One way to solve the problem of defining MS variants is with process profiles.

As instance of a mutliple sclerosis disease course contains an instance of a process profile (relapsing remitting, secondary progressive or primary progressive) which characterizes the degree of neurological functioning of the organism that bears the disease.

A class has been created to represent temporal parts of disease courses. However, the solution is still under development.")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000116 obo:ND_0006009 "This may belong under OGMS 'progressive disease course'. It is unlcear at this time how to make sense of the distinctions between OGMS disease courses. All realizations of MS, even the replapsing variant, are considerd progressive at some level of granularity.")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:ND_0006009 "Mark Jensen")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000119 obo:ND_0006009 "TO DO")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000232 obo:ND_0006009 obo:IAO_0000123)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:ND_0006009 "multiple sclerosis disease course")
SubClassOf(obo:ND_0006009 obo:ND_0006019)
SubClassOf(obo:ND_0006009 ObjectIntersectionOf(ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:BFO_0000055 obo:ND_0000033) ObjectAllValuesFrom(obo:BFO_0000055 obo:ND_0000033)))

