AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:ND_0006011 "This is not correct. A CIS is mono- or multifocal epsiode lasting 24 hours or more. A CIS can be ADEM or ON, or any of a variety of other neurologic episode. Not sure where to put CIS in ontology. It could be that CIS is merely a supercalss of types of diagnosis, charaterizing cases of possible MS. MJ")
