# Class: obo:ND_0006051 (secondary progressive disease course)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:ND_0006051 "A multiple sclerosis disease course that is a temporal part of a relapsing multiple sclerosis disease course and is charaterized by a pattern of impairment in neurological functioning followed by periods of remission during which functioning continues to decrease but is at a lower level of disabilty than that of the relapse. ")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:ND_0006051 "Mark Jensen")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000119 obo:ND_0006051 "TO DO")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000232 obo:ND_0006051 obo:IAO_0000123)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:ND_0006051 "secondary progressive disease course")
SubClassOf(obo:ND_0006051 obo:ND_0006009)
SubClassOf(obo:ND_0006051 ObjectIntersectionOf(ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:BFO_0000139 obo:ND_0000201) ObjectAllValuesFrom(obo:BFO_0000139 obo:ND_0000201)))

# Class: obo:ND_0006052 (primary progressive disease course)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:ND_0006052 "A disease course part which is characterizerd by a steady decline in neurological functioning without relapse or remission.")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000116 obo:ND_0006052 "Part of a solution when process profiles were considered. Most likely this class will be deleted. ")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:ND_0006052 "Mark Jensen")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000119 obo:ND_0006052 "TO DO")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000232 obo:ND_0006052 obo:IAO_0000123)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:ND_0006052 "primary progressive disease course")
SubClassOf(obo:ND_0006052 obo:ND_0006009)
SubClassOf(obo:ND_0006052 ObjectIntersectionOf(ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:BFO_0000133 obo:ND_0000202) ObjectAllValuesFrom(obo:BFO_0000133 obo:ND_0000202)))

# Class: obo:ND_0006054 (relapsing remitting disease course)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:ND_0006054 "A disease course part that is characterized by a pattern of relapses in neurological functioning followed by periods of remission during which functioning does not decrease and is at a lower level of disability than that of the relapse.")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000116 obo:ND_0006054 "characterizes the degree of deficit and overall worsening in neurological function (eg- muscle weakness or paralysis, optical disturbances, ambulation, etc.), inlcuding frequency of relapse and remisison, in a multiple sclerosis disease course measured according to a standardized scale such as the Kurtze Expanded Disability Status Scale (EDSS).")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:ND_0006054 "Mark Jensen")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000119 obo:ND_0006054 "TO DO")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000232 obo:ND_0006054 obo:IAO_0000123)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:ND_0006054 "relapsing remitting disease course")
SubClassOf(obo:ND_0006054 obo:ND_0006009)
SubClassOf(obo:ND_0006054 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:BFO_0000132 obo:ND_0000201))

# Class: obo:ND_0006055 (disease course part)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:ND_0006055 "A disease course that is a proper temporal part of a disease course.")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000116 obo:ND_0006055 "In the case of MS, the pattern (or profile) of progression of neurological impairment is a defining clinical feature. However, it is not clear how to represent this. 

Development of this class is at an early stage and is not yet ready for implementation. The goal is to represent stages of a disease course, such as early, late, relapsing, remission, and so forth. An acute phase can be seen as a stage in a larger diseae course. The current OGMS representaition for disease courses, stages and parts, is not adequate. Or, at least, it is not adequately explained.")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:ND_0006055 "Mark Jensen")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000118 obo:ND_0006055 "disease stage")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000119 obo:ND_0006055 "TO DO")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000232 obo:ND_0006055 obo:IAO_0000123)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:ND_0006055 "disease course part")
EquivalentClasses(obo:ND_0006055 ObjectIntersectionOf(ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:BFO_0000139 obo:OGMS_0000063) ObjectAllValuesFrom(obo:BFO_0000139 obo:OGMS_0000063)))
SubClassOf(obo:ND_0006055 obo:OGMS_0000063)

