# Class: obo:elevated_cerebral_spinal_fluid_pressure (elevated cerebral spinal fluid pressure)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000232 obo:elevated_cerebral_spinal_fluid_pressure "Change entity URI

I had to move this term here in order to keep the reasoner (FaCT++) from telling me that 'normal pressure hydrocephalus' is equivalent to NOTHING.  This was due to the use of 'has material basis at all times', which has a domain/range restriction that limits it to material entities.

Alexander P. Cox")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:elevated_cerebral_spinal_fluid_pressure "elevated cerebral spinal fluid pressure")
SubClassOf(obo:elevated_cerebral_spinal_fluid_pressure obo:OGMS_0000045)

