AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000232 obo:FMA_86103 "If this class and all of its subclasses are intended to be regions and not parts of material entities, then its placement in the hierarchy here is inconsistent with the BFO hierarchy.  If this is the case, then this class properly belongs under 'immaterial entity' despite being currently located under 'material entity' due to the FMA hierarchy.  I believe that I have resolved most of the more glaring inconsistencies between BFO and FMA with this import as a temporary solution.  In the case of this class, I have left it here because there is a lot of room for confusion between referring to the regions that fiat parts of the brain occupy and the physical brain matter that occupies those regions.  Ultimately, this issue needs to be resolved by the curators of the FMA.  Hopefully they will make FMA compliant with BFO soon!

Alexander P. Cox")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000412 obo:FMA_86103 obo:fma.owl)
